{"id":"reference/Errors","kind":"langref","title":"错误","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Errors","file":"reference/Errors.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Errors","text":"错误"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Error-Set-Type","text":"错误集合类型"},{"depth":4,"slug":"The-Global-Error-Set","text":"全局错误集合"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Error-Union-Type","text":"错误联合类型"},{"depth":4,"slug":"catch","text":"catch"},{"depth":4,"slug":"try","text":"try"},{"depth":4,"slug":"errdefer","text":"errdefer"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Merging-Error-Sets","text":"合并错误集合"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Inferred-Error-Sets","text":"推导错误集合"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Error-Return-Traces","text":"错误返回追踪"},{"depth":4,"slug":"Implementation-Details","text":"实现细节"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Errors\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Errors\">错误</a></h2>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Error-Set-Type\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Set-Type\">错误集合类型</a></h3>\n\n      <p>错误集合类似于 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/enum/#enum\">enum</a>。不过，在整个编译过程中，每个错误名称都会被分配一个大于零的无符号整数。允许多次声明同一个错误名称，它们会被分配相同的整数值。</p>\n      <p>错误集合类型默认使用 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">u16</span></code>；但如果通过命令行参数 <kbd>--error-limit [num]</kbd> 指定了不同错误值的最大数量，则会使用足以表示所有错误值的最小位数整数类型。</p>\n      <p>可以将错误从子集<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>到超集：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_coerce_error_subset_to_superset.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> FileOpenError = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    AccessDenied,\n    OutOfMemory,\n    FileNotFound,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> AllocationError = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    OutOfMemory,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"coerce subset to superset\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> err = foo(AllocationError.OutOfMemory);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(FileOpenError.OutOfMemory, err);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(err: AllocationError) FileOpenError {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> err;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_coerce_error_subset_to_superset.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_coerce_error_subset_to_superset.test.coerce subset to superset...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>但是不能将错误从超集<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>到子集：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> FileOpenError = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    AccessDenied,\n    OutOfMemory,\n    FileNotFound,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> AllocationError = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    OutOfMemory,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"coerce superset to subset\"</span> {\n    foo(FileOpenError.OutOfMemory) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> {};\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(err: FileOpenError) AllocationError {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> err;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig:16:12: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">expected type 'error{OutOfMemory}', found 'error{AccessDenied,FileNotFound,OutOfMemory}'\n</span>    return err;\n           <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig:16:12: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">'error.AccessDenied' not a member of destination error set\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig:16:12: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">'error.FileNotFound' not a member of destination error set\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig:15:28: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">function return type declared here\n</span>fn foo(err: FileOpenError) AllocationError {\n                           <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-2m\">referenced by:\n    test.coerce superset to subset: /home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_coerce_error_superset_to_subset.zig:12:8\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>声明仅包含一个值的错误集合并立即取得该值，有一种简写形式：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">single_value_error_set_shortcut.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> err = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.FileNotFound;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这等价于：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">single_value_error_set.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> err = (<span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{FileNotFound}).FileNotFound;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Inferred-Error-Sets\">推导错误集合</a>时，这种写法很有用。</p>\n      <h4 id=\"The-Global-Error-Set\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#The-Global-Error-Set\">全局错误集合</a></h4>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span></code> 表示全局错误集合。它包含整个编译单元中的全部错误，也就是其他所有错误集合的并集。</p>\n      <p>可以将任意错误集合<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>到全局错误集合，也可以将全局错误集合中的错误显式转换到非全局集合。后者会插入语言级断言，确保该错误值确实属于目标错误集合。</p>\n      <p>通常应避免使用全局错误集合，因为它使编译器无法在编译时确定可能出现的错误。编译时已知的错误集合有利于生成文档和有帮助的错误信息，例如提示 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a> 遗漏了某个可能的错误值。</p>\n      \n      \n      <h3 id=\"Error-Union-Type\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Union-Type\">错误联合类型</a></h3>\n\n      <p>错误集合类型和普通类型可以通过二元运算符 <code>!</code> 组合为错误联合类型。通常，错误联合类型比单独的错误集合类型更常用。</p>\n      <p>以下函数将字符串解析为六十四位整数：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">error_union_parsing_u64.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> maxInt = std.math.maxInt;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">parseU64</span>(buf: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, radix: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> x: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (buf) |c| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> digit = charToDigit(c);\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (digit &gt;= radix) {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.InvalidChar;\n        }\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// x *= radix</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ov = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@mulWithOverflow</span>(x, radix);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] != <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OverFlow;\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// x += digit</span>\n        ov = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@addWithOverflow</span>(ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>], digit);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] != <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OverFlow;\n        x = ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> x;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">charToDigit</span>(c: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (c) {\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">'0'</span>...<span class=\"tok-str\">'9'</span> =&gt; c - <span class=\"tok-str\">'0'</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">'A'</span>...<span class=\"tok-str\">'Z'</span> =&gt; c - <span class=\"tok-str\">'A'</span> + <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-str\">'a'</span>...<span class=\"tok-str\">'z'</span> =&gt; c - <span class=\"tok-str\">'a'</span> + <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>,\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; maxInt(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>),\n    };\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"parse u64\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> result = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> parseU64(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"1234\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> std.testing.expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>, result);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test error_union_parsing_u64.zig</kbd>\n1/1 error_union_parsing_u64.test.parse u64...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>注意返回类型为 <code>!<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code>，表示函数返回无符号六十四位整数或错误。这里省略了 <code>!</code> 左侧的错误集合，因此会推导错误集合。</p>\n      <p>函数定义中，有些 return 语句返回错误，底部的 return 语句则返回 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code>。这两种类型都能<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Casting/#Type-Coercion\">强制转换</a>为 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code>。</p>\n      <p>使用这个函数的方式取决于你的目的，可能是以下某一种：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>返回错误时提供一个默认值。</li>\n        <li>返回错误时，从当前函数返回同一个错误。</li>\n        <li>完全确定不会返回错误，因此希望无条件解包。</li>\n        <li>针对每一种可能的错误采取不同操作。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h4 id=\"catch\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#catch\">catch</a></h4>\n\n      <p>如果希望提供默认值，可以使用二元运算符 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span></code>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">catch.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> parseU64 = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"error_union_parsing_u64.zig\"</span>).parseU64;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-number\">13</span>;\n    _ = number; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// ...</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>此代码中，<code>number</code> 等于成功解析字符串得到的值，或者默认值 13。二元 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span></code> 运算符右侧的类型，必须匹配错误联合解包后的类型，或者为 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span></code> 类型。</p>\n     <p>如果希望先执行一些逻辑，再通过 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span></code> 提供默认值，可以将 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span></code> 与具名<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Blocks/#Blocks\">块</a>结合：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">handle_error_with_catch_block.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> parseU64 = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"error_union_parsing_u64.zig\"</span>).parseU64;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> blk: {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 执行操作</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span> :blk <span class=\"tok-number\">13</span>;\n    };\n    _ = number; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// number 现已初始化</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h4 id=\"try\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#try\">try</a></h4>\n\n      <p>假设遇到错误时希望直接返回该错误，否则继续执行函数逻辑：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">catch_err_return.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> parseU64 = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"error_union_parsing_u64.zig\"</span>).parseU64;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> err;\n    _ = number; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// ...</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这种情况有一个简写，即 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span></code> 表达式：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">try.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> parseU64 = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"error_union_parsing_u64.zig\"</span>).parseU64;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>);\n    _ = number; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// ...</span>\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span></code> 对错误联合表达式求值。如果是错误，就从当前函数返回同一个错误；否则表达式的结果为解包后的值。</p>\n      \n      <p>也许你完全确定某个表达式绝不会产生错误，此时可以这样写：</p>\n      <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> number = parseU64(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"1234\"</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;</code>\n      <p>这里可以确定 \"1234\" 一定能成功解析，因此把 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 值放在右侧。<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 会引发需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>，所以在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 模式下默认触发安全恐慌。这样在调试应用时，如果这里<em>确实</em>出现意外错误，应用就会相应崩溃。</p>\n      <p>如果希望为每种情况采取不同操作，可以结合 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if\">if</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a> 表达式：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">handle_all_error_scenarios.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>)) |number| {\n        doSomethingWithNumber(number);\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Overflow =&gt; {\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 处理溢出……</span>\n        },\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 保证不会发生 InvalidChar（如果发生，则在调试模式崩溃）</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.InvalidChar =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>,\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>最后，也可能只想处理部分错误。此时可以在 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span></code> 分支捕获尚未处理的错误，此处得到的错误集合范围更窄：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">handle_some_error_scenarios.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doAnotherThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{InvalidChar}!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>)) |number| {\n        doSomethingWithNumber(number);\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Overflow =&gt; {\n            <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 处理溢出……</span>\n        },\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> =&gt; |leftover_err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> leftover_err,\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>必须使用变量捕获语法。如果不需要该变量，可以用 <code>_</code> 捕获，以避免 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">handle_no_error_scenarios.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">doADifferentThing</span>(str: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (parseU64(str, <span class=\"tok-number\">10</span>)) |number| {\n        doSomethingWithNumber(number);\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |_| {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 按需处理</span>\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <h4 id=\"errdefer\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#errdefer\">errdefer</a></h4>\n\n      <p>错误处理的另一个组成部分是 defer 语句。除无条件的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/defer/#defer\">defer</a> 外，Zig 还提供 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">errdefer</span></code>：当且仅当函数经由当前块返回错误时，才会在退出该块的路径上执行延迟表达式。</p>\n      <p>示例：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">errdefer_example.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">createFoo</span>(param: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) !Foo {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> tryToAllocateFoo();\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 现在已经分配 foo；函数失败时需要释放它。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 但函数成功时希望将其返回。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">errdefer</span> deallocateFoo(foo);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> tmp_buf = allocateTmpBuffer() <span class=\"tok-kw\">orelse</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OutOfMemory;\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// tmp_buf 是真正的临时资源，必须在此块退出作用域前</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 将其清理</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> deallocateTmpBuffer(tmp_buf);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (param &gt; <span class=\"tok-number\">1337</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.InvalidParam;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此处函数成功返回，因此不会运行 errdefer。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 但 defer 会运行！</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> foo;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>这样，无须通过冗长代码和额外思考来确认覆盖了每条退出路径，就能实现健壮的错误处理。释放代码始终紧邻分配代码之后。</p>\n      \n      <p>关于错误处理，还有几点补充：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>这些原语具有足够的表达能力，使“未检查错误”成为编译错误完全可行。如果确实想忽略错误，可以添加 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code>；当假设错误时，它还会在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 模式下使程序崩溃。</li>\n        <li>由于 Zig 理解错误类型，它可以预先为分支设置偏好，倾向于错误不发生的路径。这提供了一点其他语言未必具备的优化收益。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/defer/#defer\">defer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/if/#if\">if</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/switch/#switch\">switch</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n      <p>使用二元运算符 <code>!</code> 创建错误联合。可以通过编译时反射访问错误联合的子类型：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_error_union.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> expectEqual = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).testing.expectEqual;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"error union\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> foo: <span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>!<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 从错误联合的子类型强制转换：</span>\n    foo = <span class=\"tok-number\">1234</span>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 从错误集合强制转换：</span>\n    foo = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SomeError;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用编译时反射访问错误联合的载荷类型：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(foo)).error_union.payload);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用编译时反射访问错误联合的错误集合类型：</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> expectEqual(<span class=\"tok-type\">anyerror</span>, <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@typeInfo</span>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(foo)).error_union.error_set);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_error_union.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_error_union.test.error union...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <h4 id=\"Merging-Error-Sets\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Merging-Error-Sets\">合并错误集合</a></h4>\n\n      <p>使用 <code>||</code> 运算符合并两个错误集合。结果包含两个集合中的所有错误。左侧文档注释会覆盖右侧文档注释。本例中，<code>C.PathNotFound</code> 的文档注释为 <code>A doc comment</code>。</p>\n      <p>当函数根据<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>分支返回不同错误集合时，这尤其有用。例如，Zig 标准库使用 <code>LinuxFileOpenError || WindowsFileOpenError</code> 表示打开文件时的错误集合。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_merging_error_sets.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> A = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    NotDir,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// A 的文档注释</span>\n    PathNotFound,\n};\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> B = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    OutOfMemory,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// B 的文档注释</span>\n    PathNotFound,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> C = A || B;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>() C!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.NotDir;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"merge error sets\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (foo()) {\n        <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@panic</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"unexpected\"</span>);\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.OutOfMemory =&gt; <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@panic</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"unexpected\"</span>),\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.PathNotFound =&gt; <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@panic</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"unexpected\"</span>),\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.NotDir =&gt; {},\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_merging_error_sets.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_merging_error_sets.test.merge error sets...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h4 id=\"Inferred-Error-Sets\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Inferred-Error-Sets\">推导错误集合</a></h4>\n\n      <p>Zig 中许多函数可能返回错误，因此支持推导错误集合。要推导函数的错误集合，在其返回类型前添加 <code>!</code> 运算符，例如 <code>!T</code>：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_inferred_error_sets.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用推导错误集合</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add_inferred</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, a: T, b: T) !T {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ov = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@addWithOverflow</span>(a, b);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] != <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Overflow;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用显式错误集合</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">add_explicit</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>, a: T, b: T) Error!T {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> ov = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@addWithOverflow</span>(a, b);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>] != <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Overflow;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> ov[<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>];\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Error = <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>{\n    Overflow,\n};\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"inferred error set\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (add_inferred(<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">255</span>, <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>)) |_| <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Overflow =&gt; {}, <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 正确</span>\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_inferred_error_sets.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_inferred_error_sets.test.inferred error set...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>使用推导错误集合的函数会成为泛型函数，因此某些操作会更棘手，例如获取函数指针，或让错误集合在不同构建目标间保持一致。此外，推导错误集合不兼容递归。</p>\n      <p>这些情况下建议显式指定错误集合。通常可以先使用空错误集合，再依据编译错误提示逐步补全。</p>\n      <p>未来的 Zig 版本可能克服这些限制。</p>\n      \n      \n      <h3 id=\"Error-Return-Traces\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Error-Return-Traces\">错误返回追踪</a></h3>\n\n      <p>错误返回追踪会显示代码中将错误返回给调用者的所有位置。这样就可以广泛使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#try\">try</a>，即使错误最终一直传播出应用，也仍能知道发生了什么。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">error_return_trace.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> foo(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (x &gt;= <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> bar();\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> bang2();\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bar</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (baz()) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> quux();\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.FileNotFound =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> hello(),\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">baz</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> bang1();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">quux</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> bang2();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">hello</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> bang2();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bang1</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.FileNotFound;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bang2</span>() !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.PermissionDenied;\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe error_return_trace.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./error_return_trace</kbd>\nerror: PermissionDenied\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:34:5: 0x11e0c2c in bang1 (error_return_trace.zig)\n    return error.FileNotFound;\n    ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:22:5: 0x11e0c87 in baz (error_return_trace.zig)\n    try bang1();\n    ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:38:5: 0x11e0ccc in bang2 (error_return_trace.zig)\n    return error.PermissionDenied;\n    ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:30:5: 0x11e0da7 in hello (error_return_trace.zig)\n    try bang2();\n    ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:17:31: 0x11e0eb5 in bar (error_return_trace.zig)\n        error.FileNotFound =&gt; try hello(),\n                              ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:7:9: 0x11e0f95 in foo (error_return_trace.zig)\n        try bar();\n        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/error_return_trace.zig:2:5: 0x11e109c in main (error_return_trace.zig)\n    try foo(12);\n    ^\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>仔细观察此示例，这并不是栈追踪。</p>\n      <p>可以看到，最终向上传播的错误为 <code>PermissionDenied</code>，但最初引发这一过程的错误是 <code>FileNotFound</code>。<code>bar</code> 函数处理了原始错误码，随后从 switch 语句返回另一个错误。错误返回追踪清楚地展示了这一点，而栈追踪看起来则是这样：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">stack_trace.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    foo(<span class=\"tok-number\">12</span>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">foo</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (x &gt;= <span class=\"tok-number\">5</span>) {\n        bar();\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> {\n        bang2();\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bar</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (baz()) {\n        quux();\n    } <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> {\n        hello();\n    }\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">baz</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> bang1();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">quux</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    bang2();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">hello</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    bang2();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bang1</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">bang2</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@panic</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"PermissionDenied\"</span>);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe stack_trace.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./stack_trace</kbd>\nthread 704969 panic: PermissionDenied\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/stack_trace.zig:38:5: 0x11e1f2a in bang2 (stack_trace.zig)\n    @panic(\"PermissionDenied\");\n    ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/stack_trace.zig:30:10: 0x11e1fac in hello (stack_trace.zig)\n    bang2();\n         ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/stack_trace.zig:17:14: 0x11e1f63 in bar (stack_trace.zig)\n        hello();\n             ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/stack_trace.zig:7:12: 0x11e1948 in foo (stack_trace.zig)\n        bar();\n           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/stack_trace.zig:2:8: 0x11e18b1 in main (stack_trace.zig)\n    foo(12);\n       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:788:64: 0x11e11db in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types.len == 0) return wrapMain(root.main());\n                                                               ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11e0c11 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\n(process terminated by signal)\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>这里的栈追踪没有解释 <code>bar</code> 中的控制流如何到达 <code>hello()</code> 调用。要查清这一点，需要开启调试器或为应用添加更多观测手段。错误返回追踪则精确展示了错误的传播过程。</p>\n      <p>这一调试功能使开发者更容易快速迭代代码，并健壮地处理全部错误情况。这意味着 Zig 开发者为了提高开发速度，自然会倾向于编写正确、健壮的代码。</p>\n      <p>错误返回追踪在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 构建中默认启用，在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#fast\">fast</a>、<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#small\">small</a> 构建中默认关闭。</p>\n      <p>可以通过以下几种方式触发错误返回追踪功能：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>从 main 返回错误</li>\n        <li>错误传播至 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code>，且没有覆盖默认恐慌处理器</li>\n        <li>使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#errorReturnTrace\">errorReturnTrace</a> 访问当前返回追踪，可通过 <code>std.debug.dumpErrorReturnTrace</code> 打印。构建时未启用错误返回追踪支持，该函数返回编译时已知的 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optionals/#null\">null</a>。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <h4 id=\"Implementation-Details\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Errors/#Implementation-Details\">实现细节</a></h4>\n\n      <p>分析性能成本时，需要区分两种情况：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>没有返回错误时</li>\n        <li>返回错误时</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>没有返回错误时，只需一次内存写入，而且只发生在调用图中第一个调用可能失败函数的不可失败函数中，也就是返回 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code> 的函数调用返回 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span></code> 的函数时。这次写入用于在栈内存中初始化以下结构体：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">stack_trace_struct.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> StackTrace = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    index: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n    instruction_addresses: [N]<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span>,\n};</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>这里的 N 是通过调用图分析确定的最大函数调用深度。递归被忽略，并按二计算。</p>\n      <p>每个可能返回错误的函数都通过隐藏参数接收指向 <code>StackTrace</code> 的指针。该参数始终位于首位，因此很可能一直保存在寄存器中。</p>\n      <p>无错误路径的全部开销仅此而已，性能成本几乎为零。</p>\n      <p>生成返回错误的函数代码时，Zig 会在 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span></code> 语句之前生成对以下函数的调用，但仅针对返回错误的 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span></code> 语句：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">zig_return_error_fn.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// 在 LLVM IR 中标记为“no-inline”</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">__zig_return_error</span>(stack_trace: *StackTrace) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    stack_trace.instruction_addresses[stack_trace.index] = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@returnAddress</span>();\n    stack_trace.index = (stack_trace.index + <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>) % N;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n      <p>成本是两次数学运算，以及若干内存读取和写入。访问的内存范围有限，在错误向上传播期间应当一直留在缓存中。</p>\n      <p>对于代码大小成本，return 之前的一次函数调用影响不大。即便如此，仍有<a href=\"https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/690\">一项计划</a>将对 <code>__zig_return_error</code> 的调用改为尾调用，使代码大小成本真正降为零。未启用错误返回追踪时的 return 语句，在启用后可以成为一条跳转指令。</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":110,"translated":110}}
